<title>BELGIUM: Mercedes expects 1997 truck sales to rise.</title>
<headline>Mercedes expects 1997 truck sales to rise.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>German luxury auto maker Mercedes Benz AG said on Friday it says expects truck sales to rise five to ten percent in 1997.</p>
<p>The Daimler-Benz unit also said its aims for a 12 percent return on sales in its truck operations by the end of the decade.</p>
</text>
